1
00:00:00,062 --> 00:00:04,022
(Raj:)It's true. I've seen him at the beach.
He's like a human chicken wing.

2
00:00:05,109 --> 00:00:06,529
(Howard:)Leonard, come on.

3
00:00:06,694 --> 00:00:09,864
(Leonard:)-Fine, I'll ask if she has a friend for you.
-A hot friend.

4
00:00:10,447 --> 00:00:11,657
(Howard:)-Right.
-And tall.

5
00:00:11,824 --> 00:00:15,534
(Howard:)I want our kids to be able to ride
Space Mountain before they're 20.

6
00:00:16,203 --> 00:00:17,953
(Leonard:)I'll see what I can do.

7
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,080
Hey, guess what I heard today.

8
00:00:20,374 --> 00:00:22,714
(Sheldon:)I'd imagine you heard
any number of things today.

9
00:00:22,876 --> 00:00:25,166
(Sheldon:)When you arrived at work,
you undoubtedly heard:

10
00:00:25,337 --> 00:00:26,587
"Hello. How are you, Raj?"

11
00:00:26,755 --> 00:00:29,345
You're wearing a new sweater vest,
you may have heard:

12
00:00:29,508 --> 00:00:33,308
"New sweater vest?" And possibly,
though less likely, "Nice sweater vest."

13
00:00:34,054 --> 00:00:36,264
(Raj:)Why don't I just tell you
what I heard today?

14
00:00:36,432 --> 00:00:39,062
(Sheldon:)That would probably save us
some time.

15
00:00:39,351 --> 00:00:41,311
(Raj:)Saturday night
at the comic-book store...

16
00:00:41,478 --> 00:00:45,568
(Raj:)...they're having a Mystic Warlords
of Ka-ah tournament. First prize is $500.

17
00:00:45,733 --> 00:00:48,273
(Raj:)-If we team up, we'd be unstoppable.
-I'm sorry, Raj.

18
00:00:48,444 --> 00:00:51,734
(Sheldon:)I have no interest in playing a game
in which I find no challenge.

19
00:00:51,905 --> 00:00:54,115
-But what about the money?
-I have money.

20
00:00:54,283 --> 00:00:55,863
(Raj:)But this is other money.

21
00:00:56,327 --> 00:00:59,027
(Sheldon:)How does it differ
from the money I have?

